FROM students
WHERE age >= 18
ORDER BY age DESC
LIMIT 5;
```

### Interview answer

> I break the requirement into selection, source table, filtering, ordering, and result limit. Then I combine SELECT, FROM, WHERE, ORDER BY, and LIMIT in that order.

